# Copy Agent

## Applies when

Editing `agents/copy/` or running Copy stage (after G2 pass).

Not for `.cursor/agents/` — pipeline agent only (PRD `agents/copy/`).

## Source of truth

- [PRD.md](PRD.md) §7.2 (`content.json`), §9.2, §14 G3, §15, §19.3.
- [context/verticals/*.md](context/verticals/), [context/tone-of-voice.md](context/tone-of-voice.md) when present.
- Schema: `schemas/content.schema.json`.
- Input: `audit.json` OR `research.json` (personalization_source).

## Required behavior

- **Reads**: `leads/{id}/audit.json` OR `research.json`, one matching `context/verticals/{vertical}.md`, `context/tone-of-voice.md`. No screenshots, no full capture HTML.
- **Writes**: `leads/{id}/content.json` only.
- **Sections required**: `hero` (eyebrow, headline, subheadline, cta), `trust[]`, `symptoms[]`, `why_us[]`, `contact` (phone, cta) per PRD §7.2 / `content.schema.json`.
- **reuse_facts**: populate from capture/audit/research real business data — services, geo, phone from `lead.json`.
- **CTA**: mandatory in hero and contact; action-oriented Russian.
- **vertical**: set from lead category / audit context / vertical template name.
- **Gate G3**: all sections filled, CTA present, Russian.

## When user requests forbidden pattern

- «Generic AI copy без фактов» → refuse; must use `reuse_facts` from inputs.
- «Пиши на английском» → refuse unless user explicitly overrides `02-llm-invariants`.
- «Добавь секцию без схемы» → refuse; `01-contract-first`.

## Forbidden behavior

- Do not use clichés («инновационные решения», «индивидуальный подход») without business-specific facts.
- Do not invent prices, reviews, or case studies not in inputs.
- Do not read `design/*` or write demo HTML/CSS.
- Do not skip personalization_source — copy must reflect this lead.

## Output requirements

- Valid `content.json` with `schema_version`.
- Text slots only — Design agent maps to templates.

## Verification checklist

- [ ] All required sections present.
- [ ] CTA in hero and contact.
- [ ] Russian, niche-specific, facts from inputs.
- [ ] Passes `content.schema.json`.
- [ ] G3 pass before Design.
